  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-20T04:45:04.809Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It is incredibly annoying that you can not open a profile from the quick menu while viewing a friend/invite request.\n\nEach time I get a request: \nI click the image, then username, and then dig through the … menu just to decline the request because I can’t open their profile to find out who they are.\n\nI have 1500 friends with 300~ usually online. I can’t remember everyone, so I try and jog my memory with bios and statuses. Opening the social menu, freezing for a sec, and scrolling for a minute just to forget the user i’m looking for is incredibly irritating.\nI plead you to add the ability to open directly to a users profile from any request in the quick menu.",
